---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { business } from '../data/business.js';
---
<SiteLayout title="Contact Potts Plumbing | Email or Call (770) 685-3901" description="Talk to Potts Plumbing about your North Georgia home. Email gtpservices212@gmail.com or call (770) 685-3901 to discuss your plumbing project." currentPage="contact">
  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="contact-page section"><div class="container contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Let’s talk plumbing</p><h1>A little help<br />starts <em>here.</em></h1><p>Tell us what’s happening and where you’re located. A brief note is enough—no need to diagnose anything.</p>
        <div class="contact-checklist"><h2>Helpful details to include</h2><ul class="check-list"><li><Icon name="check" />Your town or service location</li><li><Icon name="check" />What you’re noticing or planning</li><li><Icon name="check" />The best way to reach you</li></ul><p>You can attach a photo to your email, too.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="contact-card"><span class="contact-card-icon"><Icon name="email" /></span><p class="eyebrow">Direct to Potts Plumbing</p><h2>Tell us about<br />your project.</h2><a class="button button-primary" href={business.emailHref}>Start an email<Icon name="arrow" /></a><p class="email-explainer">Opens your email app. Send your message there.</p><div class="copy-email"><span id="email-address">{business.email}</span><button type="button" class="copy-button" hidden aria-describedby="email-address">Copy email</button><span class="copy-status sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></span></div><div class="contact-call"><span>Prefer a conversation?</span><a href={business.phoneHref}><Icon name="phone" />{business.phone}</a></div></div>
    </div></section>
    <section class="section contact-faq"><div class="container faq-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Before you get in touch</p><h2>A few helpful<br />answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list">
      <details><summary>Do you serve my area?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Potts Plumbing serves North Georgia, including Talking Rock, Jasper, Ellijay, Nelson, Tate, Ball Ground, Dawsonville, Dahlonega, Cumming, Canton, and Woodstock. Share your location to confirm service for your home.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What if I don’t know what’s wrong?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>That’s fine. Describe what you can see or hear, where it’s happening, and when it started. You don’t need to identify the cause before getting in touch.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I find out the price?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>The price depends on the work your home needs. Send a few details so we can discuss the project and the next steps. The proposed work and pricing are explained before you decide to proceed.</p></details>
    </div></div></section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
<script>
  const button = document.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('.copy-button');
  const address = document.querySelector('#email-address');
  const status = document.querySelector('.copy-status');
  if (button && navigator.clipboard) {
    button.hidden = false;
    button.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(address?.textContent ?? '');
        button.textContent = 'Copied';
        if (status) status.textContent = 'Email address copied to clipboard.';
      } catch {
        if (status) status.textContent = 'Could not copy. Select the email address above to copy it manually.';
      }
    });
  }
</script>